Thanks to your newfound knowledge of corruption, you've learned some tricks for toughening your body… but only if you are healthy enough to withstand the strain from the changes.

Improves your life by 500, your defense by [3, 8, 16, 25, 33 (CON 10-100)], your armour by [2, 7, 14, 21, 28 (CON 10-100)], your armour hardiness by 20% and your saves by [3, 8, 16, 25, 33 (CON 10-100)] as your natural toughness and reflexes are pushed beyond their normal limits.

Your saves armour and defense will improve with your Constitution.
